  "body": "Purpose: This policy sets out the rules on sick leave notification at Vandenberg Logistics NV.\n\nPolicy: Employees notify their manager before 9:00 on the first day of absence. A medical certificate is required from the 2nd consecutive day of absence.\n\nConditions: Absences longer than 10 working days must also be reported to the HR mailbox.\n\nValidity: Version 3.0, effective 2025-01-01. Supersedes version 1.2 (2022). Approved by the Management Committee."
